@startuml kill_chain_policy_new
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 9

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

component [**Discovery Phase**\nNetwork scanning\nService enumeration\nTopology mapping] as Discovery #FFE6E6
component [**Reconnaissance**\nVulnerability assessment\nService identification\nTarget prioritization] as Recon #FFF2CC
component [**Initial Access**\nExploit vulnerabilities\nCredential access\nPrivilege escalation] as Access #E6F3FF
component [**Impact Phase**\nLateral movement\nData exfiltration\nSystem disruption] as Impact #E6FFE6

component [**Transition Logic 1**\nSufficient topology\ninformation gathered] as Logic1 #F0F0F0
component [**Transition Logic 2**\nExploitable vulnerability\nidentified] as Logic2 #F0F0F0
component [**Transition Logic 3**\nCritical system access\nachieved] as Logic3 #F0F0F0
component [**Final Objective**\nExecute attack impact\nphase] as Logic4 #F0F0F0

Discovery --> Logic1 : Phase Complete
Logic1 --> Recon : Advance
Recon --> Logic2 : Phase Complete
Logic2 --> Access : Advance
Access --> Logic3 : Phase Complete
Logic3 --> Impact : Advance
Impact --> Logic4 : Attack Complete

note bottom of Logic1 : State-based transitions\ndriven by network conditions
note bottom of Logic4 : Deterministic policy\nthrough complete kill chain

@enduml
